cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use vercel-blob-client in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "vercel-blob-client: Reverse-engineered Python REST client for Vercel Blob"
abstract: >-
  A Python client for Vercel Blob produced by reverse-engineering the
  @vercel/blob JavaScript SDK. The upload endpoint (vercel.com/api/blob) and
  the private-fetch pattern (storeId.private.blob.vercel-storage.com/key)
  are both undocumented; this client provides a production-proven
  implementation validated against a multi-gigabyte research corpus.
type: software
